emy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>100-Night Risk-Free Trial</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="r-cegkwr" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="c61c39b3-9baa-4e78-b0cc-1409341945ed" class="r-1ht6pzy"><div data-rid="1d267ee3-7e5c-4fc9-a5bc-0a74426ccc12" class="r-1kdbmsi"><div data-rid="45e8a25d-4206-480c-88f2-7ea91d312d0e" class="r-q80iz2"><div data-rid="5774eef9-34c0-4353-84b8-62733755fd27" class="r-ks6x8s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>4</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="52898c0f-6bbd-4626-a726-a82bca018a24" class="r-1i4alhd"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/4th_Image_Fiber_Glass_on_Mattress.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/4th_Image_Fiber_Glass_on_Mattress.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/4th_Image_Fiber_Glass_on_Mattress.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/4th_Image_Fiber_Glass_on_Mattress.png?v=1791895504" class="r-yd9dgl" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div data-rid="b8402168-79e5-43b8-b00f-49a08c9143c8" class="r-plskey"><div data-rid="b195ed2a-b9f9-49a0-927a-06cec6b2ca76" class="r-1fdwkkd"><div data-rid="3f2fb626-01d1-42d9-b53e-1844cd4d2649" class="r-1uuw8kk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>THE GLASS</p></span></div><div data-rid="e4e52415-a6c9-47d1-bd9a-f6d0265596f8" class="r-89eluo"></div></div><div data-rid="3eecd4e5-279c-48e2-bac8-d8ac4c30f45f" class="r-bk9z56"><div data-rid="7f457391-9a30-45b2-8b23-4e7197dfdfa9" class="r-pxfb2x alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>There May Be Glass in Your Bed. Not a Metaphor. Actual Glass.</p></span></div><div data-rid="0966bda6-be80-445a-878a-61a35ca073a3" class="r-2hf2al alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every mattress sold in America must pass a federal open-flame test. Many budget and mid-range foam mattresses pass it with a fiberglass sock hidden under the cover.</p><br><p>It stays put, until someone unzips the cover to wash it. Families have reported glass fibers spreading into carpets, clothing and air vents, and needing professional cleanup to get them out.</p><br><p>The Ultimate Snooze passes the same fire test with CLOUDWOOL™ organic wool, which resists flame naturally. No fiberglass. No chemical fire sprays.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="r-ax4khi" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="887a6b27-6a36-4ea8-a23c-05c8c63c8e0d" class="r-x2gylq"><div data-rid="72a5467a-748b-4522-bb03-dd2472717e41" class="r-1xggon2"><div data-rid="85cf969f-29a7-4428-b695-769bc4d50f76" class="r-w3ob84"><div data-rid="10d800ee-080e-4e74-b753-a0b9b6579c25" class="r-156lhgl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>THE FIRE CHEMISTRY</p></span></div><div data-rid="02b55f07-b119-463a-b715-54d0a9757f5f" class="r-sjm50h"></div></div><div data-rid="145614fd-47c3-4e51-8039-f753a364a9a2" class="r-13uyozd"><div data-rid="6e5a30d9-37b6-403d-8b0e-be7acf4f8e53" class="r-1egy6u3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Foam Burns Fast. So Somebody Had to Make It Stop. Ask Them How.</p></span></div><div data-rid="ff0d7651-83da-4765-85c6-30522624f02c" class="r-nva2co alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Polyurethane foam is highly flammable on its own. To pass the federal fire test, manufacturers wrap or treat it with something, and they are not required to tell you what.</p><p><br></p><p>Some have used chemical flame retardants. Some use fiberglass. Some use treated synthetic fabrics. The law tag on your mattress almost never says which one you're sleeping on.</p><p><br></p><p>The Ultimate Snooze doesn't need a chemical answer. Organic wool is naturally flame-resistant, so the fire barrier is the same wool that keeps you cool.<br><br><strong>A material that needs chemicals to be safe was never safe to begin with.</strong></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="9a71e0a2-c615-447a-9a24-32955e2cd86c" class="r-jiwe6j"><div data-rid="11fd8033-229e-4680-8aa7-d135f75212ce" class="r-1rszr7g"><div data-rid="864434d5-4d3b-40cc-82dc-6c2cb5413d92" class="r-1o2igmt alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>5</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="e069a519-338c-4844-b3f9-cc9dd33a628a" class="r-l3yn0t"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/5th_Image_-_Enhanced.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/5th_Image_-_Enhanced.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/5th_Image_-_Enhanced.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/5th_Image_-_Enhanced.png?v=1791895504" class="r-udjq3w" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div><div class="r-hyaxkh" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="6d03386c-f560-4738-a9aa-18e009068a2e" class="r-wjdvh2"><div data-rid="cb53d37d-bc55-4d1c-83a0-fe5122e47fec" class="r-uvcndd"><div data-rid="74b33ed0-684d-4db0-a010-da457c376eed" class="r-37lu00"><div data-rid="0d8d9137-9e0f-4fbd-b4f5-299cb4900b0c" class="r-10anrvs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>6</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="e1411925-6e72-4e33-a626-db81d73166ee" class="r-129ez7a"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/6th_Image_-_Adhesives.png?v=1791895503&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/6th_Image_-_Adhesives.png?v=1791895503&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/6th_Image_-_Adhesives.png?v=1791895503&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/6th_Image_-_Adhesives.png?v=1791895503" class="r-12l4yzq" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div data-rid="7a0f4933-4abc-4cd9-81dd-c01eeeb820d1" class="r-v2vfk5"><div data-rid="766f1aef-d054-4007-bd08-46fc65c139d1" class="r-66w7no"><div data-rid="5609b910-192f-4bc0-8a72-fe82ca055b83" class="r-18c29q alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>THE GLUE</p></span></div><div data-rid="9a17cc9e-74fa-4ac2-9e63-74b975aa6dde" class="r-12650rg"></div></div><div data-rid="f629abbc-4d0b-446f-942e-f99048ae6b86" class="r-7o9beb"><div data-rid="a733ee5c-68f1-4f58-90f3-d3a2df524e5d" class="r-q1vqay alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your Mattress Is Glued Together Like a Cheap Sneaker. You Know How Those End.</p></span></div><div data-rid="a397e1a9-46e8-404a-b315-d0281ab85d05" class="r-1iulafj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most foam mattresses are stacks of foam slabs bonded with industrial adhesives. Adhesives are one of the sources of the chemical smell from Reason 1, and they sit in every seam, between every layer.</p><p><br></p><p>They're also why foam layers separate and shift as the glue ages, and why your "luxury" layer slowly slides out of place.</p><p><br></p><p>The Ultimate Snooze uses zero glue. Every layer is hand-tufted together by craftspeople in the USA, the way mattresses were built before speed and cost took over.<br><br><strong>If it needs glue to stay together, it won't stay together.</strong></p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="r-1a855zr" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="18527616-c0fb-4b1b-a0d4-bbe8e5f8496f" class="r-myuvqe"><div data-rid="d71faabb-419a-4820-bfbe-af4bf93bdd69" class="r-3phzav"><div data-rid="85583256-ebf9-4fd5-816a-780b6bf56b4d" class="r-14tw59y"><div data-rid="70b10f61-00f2-4310-9ceb-a06789dd36d2" class="r-uh8bmz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>THE SWEAT</p></span></div><div data-rid="1d0a05c0-7a3d-4e32-80e1-945162234b1a" class="r-1i4a338"></div></div><div data-rid="458cd1cd-073c-4ddd-9d1c-f0ebfe7b17c0" class="r-1uu052d"><div data-rid="1f27f717-826a-4937-87dc-fd888da56a3d" class="r-w9h0po alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every Night, You Sweat Into Your Mattress. Every Morning, You Make the Bed Over It.</p></span></div><div data-rid="ec9ab211-9d13-4195-9e3e-d5a6e4a1af29" class="r-19c9f3s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You release moisture every night, whether you feel damp or not. In a dense synthetic mattress, there's nowhere for it to go.</p><br><p>Warm and humid is exactly the climate dust mites thrive in, along with the musty smell that eventually no protector can hide.</p><br><p>Organic wool works differently. It pulls moisture away from your body and lets it evaporate, so the inside of your mattress stays drier, night after night.<br><br><strong>Clean sheets on a damp mattress is just a nicer-looking problem.</strong></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="ee75fde7-8114-4cd7-90a0-962d7df213b0" class="r-6yqlb0"><div data-rid="32a0cc43-2113-4339-9b02-ba954bb7334e" class="r-x28ohv"><div data-rid="4b1f1a59-09a7-4311-ada0-98b02fcf1ea5" class="r-d927v6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>7</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="cbae7fad-c35c-453a-b33c-4fd995cd9ce5" class="r-1vzl0k4"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/0e05a2f1-e9b8-49d9-9ebd-27b234f0d6bb?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/0e05a2f1-e9b8-49d9-9ebd-27b234f0d6bb?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/0e05a2f1-e9b8-49d9-9ebd-27b234f0d6bb?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/0e05a2f1-e9b8-49d9-9ebd-27b234f0d6bb" class="r-1ypiel9" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div><div class="r-58dl80" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="6dbd0963-c487-4c42-adf0-402e42a8bd31" class="r-14vpfzy"><div data-rid="29ae22fd-ea56-4e4c-b4d8-9979ff8cfde4" class="r-hu4s77"><div data-rid="d119c75c-000b-47d4-b189-d2e38e90b6dc" class="r-b04s29"><div data-rid="77b56206-6d2c-4d5d-a8b3-b1a60c035ff5" class="r-14mauo2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>8</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="8c13c9a1-967f-428c-ab95-bc695218778f" class="r-uo0ihw"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/instagram-image_7cadbe39-7e36-4655-b8fb-3c359f85fd28.jpg?v=1783614814&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/instagram-image_7cadbe39-7e36-4655-b8fb-3c359f85fd28.jpg?v=1783614814&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/instagram-image_7cadbe39-7e36-4655-b8fb-3c359f85fd28.jpg?v=1783614814&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/instagram-image_7cadbe39-7e36-4655-b8fb-3c359f85fd28.jpg?v=1783614814" class="r-e32ihp" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div data-rid="91b6febc-0498-4fde-9e86-2c85e7ed9812" class="r-p68rlj"><div data-rid="bdcdf109-71a8-4743-9237-f515f6e35dbc" class="r-coz360"><div data-rid="a9e77b2a-6896-493f-bfe2-ead310c8517c" class="r-1fqtzlo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>THE SAG</p></span></div><div data-rid="f60129f1-0a00-49d9-bc13-50f67930e3bf" class="r-j4xyi5"></div></div><div data-rid="6290f9c9-7760-4a36-82bd-e8d0932143a5" class="r-1chlz2k"><div data-rid="84af7a62-2116-4ad0-8cd4-4970f4cf2b0e" class="r-ulghwx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Look at Your Mattress From the Side. If You Can See Where You Sleep, Your Spine Has Been Sleeping in a Hole.</p></span></div><div data-rid="551d33c6-e7de-4f63-a505-2a0a64093d1d" class="r-id3jvo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Foam compresses every night and never fully comes back. Most foam mattresses start developing body impressions within a few years, long before they're "worn out" on paper.</p><br><p>That dip pulls your hips below your shoulders for hours at a time. It's one reason people wake up stiff and blame their age.</p><br><p>The Ultimate Snooze has no foam to collapse. A 4" organic latex layer springs back instead of sinking. Underneath, 1,100 pocketed coils in five zones keep your spine level, with a 30-year warranty on craftsmanship and structural integrity.</p><p><br></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="8512bd16-26b0-434b-9e1f-236cbd437dd9" class="r-l6c5xy"><div data-rid="64241529-6503-4c46-81a3-9ca370b85f0f" class="r-1dhecxa"><div data-rid="e64117a4-2a3d-471c-86f0-928daa768334" class="r-905idz"><div data-rid="cb53c0ac-75ca-46c8-90c3-52916293df86" class="r-1hv357j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>One Bed Made For Every Body</p></span></div><div data-rid="519ee702-d8e0-4da6-a6d0-099b4ee57944" class="r-19u9mri alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>A single design at adapts to every body: side, back, stomach sleepers, and even the tossers and turners.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="761e22de-21e2-4e6c-9846-ad7f4cdd232e" class="r-pnm9w8" id="replo-carousel::Rlj2:" role="region" aria-label="Carousel" data-replo-carousel="true"><div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" class="replo-sr-only">Slide <!-- -->1<!-- --> of <!-- -->6</div><button type="button" data-replo-component-root="carousel" data-replo-part="nav-button" data-direction="previous" aria-label="Previous slide" data-rid="a87e6db0-bfc3-4e07-9ef0-7e230efaefca" class="r-157wqc3 r-hyfqqc"><div data-rid="46571b72-5bc6-43f4-8c7e-d3e691da46eb" class="r-10hzsse"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="n